# Flash and BIOS dumps. Never commit these.
#
# dsfirmware.bin holds the WiFi passphrase in PLAINTEXT (slot 4-6 offset 0x120), the console's
# MAC address at 0x36, the Nintendo WFC user ID at 0xF0, and the owner's nickname/birthday in
# the user settings block. The BIOS dumps are copyrighted Nintendo code.
dsidump/
*.bin
*.sav

# Backup files the app produces contain the same passphrases.
DSIWIFI/
*.dswifi

__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# Build output. *.bin above already covers the fixtures that land in build/.
build/
build.log
*.nds
*.dsi
*.elf
*.map
*.o
*.a
*.d

# Icon and logo drafts. Deliberately out of the repo for now -- 60-odd variants of
# the same image, and nothing in the build references them yet. Drop this line once
# one is chosen and wired into GAME_ICON.
resources/
